/wisconsin/polk-county"],["ARC or PLC in Polk County","/arc-plc/wisconsin/polk-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Polk County record runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids January to February and September to October each came in under 90% of normal in 36 of the 75 years. In 2025, October to November came in at 44% of normal and September to October at 62% on the middle of the grids. Every grid shown had its driest year in 1976, at 54% to 59% of normal for 1976.</p>"}
